 "name": "steep_climb",
 "_tests": "a freeway crossing sustained relief \u2014 ground rising ~6% under a road limited to 4%, with a hill on top of the tilt so the climb is not monotonic \u2014 plus a street crossing on the slope and a ramp climbing off it. Every imported city that failed did so on grades; the authored corpus had only a single hill and a single valley, neither of them long.",
