  "citysim": {
    "_comment_clock": "8 km world: agents move at real m/s while the clock runs at hoursPerSecond, so 0.05 (180x) made a 3 km commute cost 12.5 in-world hours and a 50 m walk 1.8 h. 0.004 gives a 100-minute day and a ~1 h commute.",
    "_comment_dormancy": "P5: agents past ~1.2 km stop being simulated entirely and are rebuilt from their schedule when the player returns. Their parked cars stay put \u2014 dormancy strips the agent, never the vehicle.",
